    "Let agents open links on screen" : {

    },
    "Let agents use the microphone" : {

    },
    "Lets M1K3 ground answers in the moment — battery, your next events, where you are (a coarse ~10 km area unless Precise is on). Snapshots only: never remembered, never mixed with web tools in a turn. macOS asks its own permission when you switch Calendar or Location on." : {

    },
    "Lets an agent on this Mac use M1K3's knowledge, memory and voice. Loopback-only, one client at a time. An agent needs the access token to connect. Listening, deleting memories and opening links stay off until you allow them." : {

    },
    "Lets other apps on this Mac use the brain M1K3 has loaded, with their own instructions: no M1K3 personality, memory, knowledge or tools, and nothing they send is kept. Point any OpenAI-compatible tool at the base URL and use the API key. Loopback-only, one call at a time, and you always go first. M1K3's brains are chosen and tested inside M1K3; how one behaves under another app's instructions is for you to judge." : {

